<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan buys 54,000T Argentine corn from Toepfer.</title>
<headline>Taiwan buys 54,000T Argentine corn from Toepfer.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry group bought 54,000 tonnes of Argentine corn from Toepfer at a tender on Thursday, traders said.  </p>
<p>The Members Feed Industry group comprises Taiwan's Formosa Oilseed, Fomau Cereal, Morn Sun Feed Mill and Shin Tai Industry.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>Shipment     Tonnes</p>
<p>Argentina		78.50 UScents/May</p>
<p>One 54,000 April 10-30</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
